# Data cache: COMMITTED on purpose (total ~1.4 MB). A frozen snapshot means
# every team member and judge reproduces byte-identical results without
# needing an EconData token, and the demo works offline. To refresh the
# data, delete a parquet and re-run `python run.py fetch` (needs a token).

